"Rabbit Welcome is Anesidora's annual event for new Rabbits, held for 34 years by 2040."
"It runs 5:30 to 9:30 PM with conference-hall booths, free rabbit-ear headbands and an interface map."
"In 2040 it moved to Nautilus Needle and The Verne after the flood took its usual venue."
"Wrights, employers and a wizard-culture consultant for Avowed in trouble mid-summons run booths."
"The High Councilor elected to represent Rabbits gives the closing speech."
